    content/system-design/*.md      the eight reference designs
    scripts/harness/python_runner.py
    scripts/run-solution.sh
    scripts/canvas-server.js
    scripts/ensure-canvas.sh
    viewer/canvas.html

Changes made: the eight reference designs have their `companies_known_to_ask`
frontmatter removed. The harness reads `JOBFORGE_TIMEOUT_S` instead of
`SWE_CODING_TIMEOUT_S`. The upstream `/coding-import` command and its fallback to
the third-party `alfa-leetcode-api.onrender.com` mirror are not carried over, by
design: no jobforge code path sends a user's requests through someone else's
server.

Not derived: the pattern taxonomy in content/patterns/ is written from scratch
around a different organising idea (a falsifiable discriminator plus a
required-elements checklist per pattern), and the plugin spine — hooks,
scheduling, the bank, verbal-plan grading and the interview schema — has no
upstream counterpart.
